      "content": "but you said it itself... what if the only way to actually protect them is to not pass it on? i look at my little sister and i see the same eyes, the same potential for the same spiral. if i'm just a link in this chain of misery, maybe the most selfless thing i could do is just... be the one who makes sure it doesn't go any further. like, if the cycle stops with me, then it's finally over for everyone. wouldn't that be better than letting it all happen again?",
